  "source_pdf": "downloads/wukongs-brick-building-day-v3-zh-Hans.pdf",
  "source_sha256": "842462045f5e01197a409806df429155c87cc51fe59248f62f157f622f1ff8ca",
  "pixel_width": 1224,
  "pages": [
    {
      "image": "page-01.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "acce40b433113be05cfcbd6b43c9aeea8795a7650d2749f8826fb4194a4b8f78",
      "text": "悟空的\n积木城堡",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-02.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "04f6a0b73af8c535d8a0fd4465993ae3efbfd16b75a86a1bdef8178777dcd99a",
      "text": "悟空有个大主意。\n“我要搭一座高高的城堡！”\n2",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-03.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "33abec345b89ce542cead8ffc90e23da0f0c0999e885f28dc840269f1ec09a70",
      "text": "“屋顶交给我！”哪吒说。\n“我来搭厨房！”八戒说。\n3",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-04.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "2f9aa42f0dc5537a40c7ce88179433fecbe687a23c3a1f7f0a99f105aa2f4a65",
      "text": "悟空一块一块往上搭。\n下面只有窄窄的一小块。\n4",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-05.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "b26666f881a34d0536543af6ebd39986673429739610371b1561f5face5e4f6a",
      "text": "哪吒刚把屋顶放上去，\n城堡就晃了起来！\n5",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-06.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "8d531bc5c27173a55acce6697a76eebeb9a5bffa623e0bf33645e6aa751dbe99",
      "text": "悟空用尾巴扶住这边，\n那边又晃起来了！\n6",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-07.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "033fc16ced0108b2145d96a5899847fed1b8fbd91ce93baf008090e37a386418",
      "text": "他们赶紧拿下屋顶。\n悟空往地上一坐。\n“怎么就是站不稳呢？”\n7",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-08.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "71c1b4a9e62d52a40af323edae183e82ef89a2424e3f5eba49d46cd968bebeda",
      "text": "“下面铺宽一点试试？”哪吒说。\n“像我的饭盘那么宽！”八戒说。\n8",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-09.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "4d4777a66574f354f8678d29c17e433a0f7886b216677274721cdffa042d5a7c",
      "text": "他们拆下几块积木，\n把下面一圈铺得宽宽的。\n9",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-10.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "f87fccb7e7e924122eb4dbadcfed29060e9c7ad3501b94ba485be0dacb115263",
      "text": "咔嗒，咔嗒。\n一块连着一块，\n墙壁也搭牢了。\n10",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-11.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "80119a23bff7200d6ef21f258a10015b40efd73ea37c3b7c7f4fbbc74d4cf832",
      "text": "哪吒装回蓝屋顶。\n这回，城堡稳稳地站住了！\n八戒说：“该布置我的厨房啦！”\n11",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-12.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "c737c90929d9f762a62ec432710f6dca1e6fe0d17e61977f76a03321317f03ac",
      "text": "八戒抱来玩具小锅。\n往门里一送——\n咚，卡住了！\n12",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-13.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "e642adfadffc2d6b01c505f95a9f17d381b962008587ae13c23fe2dad3da3188",
      "text": "八戒瞧瞧空锅，\n又拍拍锅肚子。\n“小锅呀，你能不能瘦一点？”\n13",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-14.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "48a111883e268bb59ba49ac8e4fc6f52f131e9aa17f84585c21769cbcb710431",
      "text": "悟空看看刚搭好的墙。\n“难道又要拆呀？”\n14",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-15.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "3ebcc2e37435a0d56a4ca14c8c1e545a31fac0f7c4fbde8c4a1459e59cb3a1da",
      "text": "“只改这一小块。”哪吒说。\n“把门开大一点就好。”\n15",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-16.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "7921c5458fbf8d4461dacbe54d87fd2f672f085b6121a09fb9a6ea51a45341a6",
      "text": "他们先取下蓝屋顶，\n挪一挪门边的积木。\n小门变大门啦！\n16",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-17.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "75ac111133fd3dd0f666f3b46c0b6bfbe9127a55741266137cb2c0187025abbc",
      "text": "八戒又试了一次。\n“进去喽！”\n这回，小锅顺顺当当进了门。\n17",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-18.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "0a0cc7844d072a3d56944a4ead77e27f43744feef33caae6691ae4f162c549fa",
      "text": "蓝屋顶装回去了，\n小玩偶也一个接一个进了大门。\n18",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-19.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "a6412b7cb0856c7ced0f5f541ab1daaa56928eabebe0b5236d39488a62bce500",
      "text": "悟空又留了一个小窗。\n尾巴尖从窗里伸出来，摇呀摇。\n“城堡，你好呀！”\n19",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-20.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "1e2ae77c7acf00ba95b18864ebc48f8141d006c568e57bf912f6082bc1121047",
      "text": "散落的积木收好了。\n小玩偶们都有地方待啦。\n小厨房也热热闹闹开张啦。\n20",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-21.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "a2a0a5e82ccb3d7d450fa81617f21460ac2a26e51f130a83154778db134ebe17",
      "text": "Wukong & Friends\n谢谢你们一起读故事！\n希望你和孩子\n喜欢这次小小的冒险。\n更多免费故事\nphg1024.github.io/wukong-and-friends/zh\n免费阅读、下载和打印。\n阅读更多免费故事\n如果喜欢这个故事，欢迎支持我继续创作。\n支持完全自愿。\nBuy Me a Coffee\nGitHub Sponsors\nPeihong Guo 创作\n故事与插画由 AI 辅助创作并经人工编辑。\n© 2026 Peihong Guo\nCC BY-NC-ND 4.0 · 署名—非商业性使用—禁止演绎\ncreativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-nd/4.0/",
